     ("Does an older house meet the seismic code?", "Not necessarily: RPS 2000, revised in 2011, requires features that many older houses, or those built without an engineering firm, do not have. A structural assessment can check this."),
     ("Can you add a storey to a house you buy?", "Only if the existing foundations, columns and floors can carry the additional load, which an engineer must verify by calculation, and with a building permit."),
